  "createdAt": "2026-10-11T17:20:34.925582Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T21:13:12.088041Z",
  "totalBlocks": 35,
  "translatedBlocks": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4034aca5d1fc105",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 于 12 月推出 GPT-5.2，称其为迄今在专业知识工作领域能力最强的模型系列。该模型在 NVIDIA 基础设施上进行训练和部署，包括 NVIDIA Hopper 和 GB200 NVL72 系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e73178d974cab2a6",
      "translationZh": "GPT-5.3 Codex 于 2 月发布，它是 OpenAI 首个参与自身构建的智能体式编码模型，其训练和推理服务完全在 GB200 NVL72 上进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78ce07d5daeb7fbc",
      "translationZh": "GPT-5.2 在 GPQA-Diamond、AIME 2025 和 Tau2 Telecom 等行业基准测试中取得了已报告的最高分。在 ARC-AGI-2 等针对开发 AGI 所需技能的领先基准测试中，GPT-5.2 为最先进性能树立了新标杆。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6c5a8824870001e",
      "translationZh": "GPT 5.3-Codex 将 GPT‑5.2-Codex 的编码性能与 GPT‑5.2 的推理能力融合在一个模型中，速度提升了 25%。在用于评估编码、智能体及现实世界能力的四项基准测试中，GPT 5.3-Codex 在 SWE-Bench Pro 和 Terminal-Bench 上创下了新的行业最高纪录，同时在 OSWorld 和 GDPval 基准测试中也展现了强劲表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea6f5b8e25a5b09",
      "translationZh": "GPT 5.2 和 GPT 5.3-Codex 是领先 AI 开发者如何在 NVIDIA 全栈 AI 基础设施上进行大规模训练和部署的最新实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cc28c91deb016a4",
      "translationZh": "预训练：智能的基石",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce3e451ebf7b491c",
      "translationZh": "得益于三种扩展定律，AI 模型的能力正不断增强：预训练、后训练和测试时扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "895e78429196dc51",
      "translationZh": "推理模型如今已无处不在，它们在推理过程中投入计算资源，利用多个网络协同工作来处理复杂查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c98e6841f5d0e42d",
      "translationZh": "但预训练和后训练仍然是智能的基石。它们是让推理模型变得更智能、更实用的核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdd339651a2b947d",
      "translationZh": "而要做到这一点，就需要规模。从零开始训练前沿模型并不是一项小工程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad4e7c536da0d527",
      "translationZh": "这需要数万、甚至数十万个 GPU 高效协同工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27bdd9eb7aa3932d",
      "translationZh": "这种规模要求在多个维度上都达到卓越水平。它需要世界一流的加速器，覆盖 scale-up、scale-out 以及日益普及的 scale-across 架构的先进网络，还需要经过全面优化的软件栈。简而言之，需要一个专门构建的基础设施平台，以在大规模运行时提供高性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac447712c1b8844b",
      "translationZh": "在最新的 MLPerf Training 行业基准测试中，对于所测试的最大模型，NVIDIA GB200 NVL72 系统的训练性能达到 NVIDIA Hopper 架构的 3 倍，每美元性能则接近其 2 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7258d7e4a213d43",
      "translationZh": "而与 NVIDIA Hopper 相比，NVIDIA GB300 NVL72 实现了超过 4 倍的加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c7f25b653e988b",
      "translationZh": "这些性能提升帮助 AI 开发者缩短开发周期，更快地部署新模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2e175cbfdfc6f524",
      "translationZh": "各类模态的模型都印证了这一点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f64a39c17a35c00",
      "translationZh": "当今大多数领先的大语言模型都是在 NVIDIA 平台上训练的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c3269f9fb3a91db",
      "translationZh": "AI 不仅仅关乎文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6747eedda42e9d7f",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 支持跨多种模态的 AI 开发，包括语音、图像和视频生成，以及生物学和机器人技术等新兴领域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36020279a80dadeb",
      "translationZh": "例如，Evo 2 等模型解码基因序列，OpenFold3 预测 3D 蛋白质结构，Boltz-2 模拟药物相互作用，帮助研究人员更快地识别有潜力的候选对象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d39e726775975f6",
      "translationZh": "在临床方面，NVIDIA Clara 合成模型生成逼真的医学图像，在不暴露患者数据的情况下推动筛查和诊断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a55e25d7212c333b",
      "translationZh": "Runway 和 Inworld 等公司在 NVIDIA 基础设施上进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d94406e1e42989d8",
      "translationZh": "Runway 上周发布了 Gen-4.5，这是一款新的前沿视频生成模型，根据 Artificial Analysis 排行榜，它目前是全球评分最高的视频模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc91b2c81fd822e8",
      "translationZh": "Gen-4.5 现已针对 NVIDIA Blackwell 进行优化，从初期研究与开发到预训练、后训练和推理，其整个开发过程都在 NVIDIA GPU 上完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c270fda4b84e029e",
      "translationZh": "Runway 还发布了 GWM-1，这是一款在 NVIDIA Blackwell 上训练的先进通用世界模型，旨在实时模拟现实世界。它具备交互性、可控性和通用性，可应用于电子游戏、教育、科学、娱乐和机器人领域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d4737b0b8fc4c62",
      "translationZh": "MLPerf 是衡量训练性能的行业标准基准。在最新一轮测试中，NVIDIA 提交了全部七项 MLPerf Training 5.1 基准测试的结果，展现出强大的性能和多功能性。它是唯一在每个类别中都提交了结果的平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "481dde81bda12b70",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 支持多种 AI 工作负载的能力，有助于数据中心更高效地利用资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "276fe34c5d60308a",
      "translationZh": "这就是为什么 Black Forest Labs、Cohere、Mistral、OpenAI、Reflection 和 Thinking Machines Lab 等 AI 实验室都在 NVIDIA Blackwell 平台上进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f6998b3763d1da7",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Blackwell 遍及云端和数据中心",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbbbaa14d3f1fc9c",
      "translationZh": "领先的云服务提供商、新兴云服务商和服务器制造商已广泛提供 NVIDIA Blackwell。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de7738703875ee2",
      "translationZh": "而 NVIDIA Blackwell Ultra 提供了更多算力、更大内存和架构改进，目前正由服务器制造商和云服务提供商陆续推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4583480959e795d7",
      "translationZh": "主要云服务提供商和 NVIDIA Cloud Partners，包括 Amazon Web Services、CoreWeave、Google Cloud、Lambda、Microsoft Azure、Nebius、Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 和 Together AI 等，已经提供由 NVIDIA Blackwell 驱动的实例，确保在预训练规模持续扩大的过程中提供可扩展的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c6d0c8b60631fa8",
      "translationZh": "从前沿模型到日常 AI，未来正构建于 NVIDIA 之上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8829ec1f1970cb2a",
      "translationZh": "了解更多关于 NVIDIA Blackwell 平台的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "999989c0ebff9015",
      "translationZh": "编者注：本文已于 2026 年 2 月 6 日更新，纳入了来自 OpenAI 及其 GPT-5.3 Codex 的最新模型信息。请持续关注 OpenAI 后续的模型发布和新数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
